  "question": {
    "text": "A particle moving in a circle of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> with uniform speed takes time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math> to complete one revolution. If this particle is projected with the same speed at an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi></math> to the horizontal, the maximum height attained by it is equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>R</mi></math>. The angle of projection <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi></math> is then given by :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
